  "deletedBy": null,
  "details": "Dear VRChat Team,\n\nI would like to address an issue that many users are facing: children in VRChat who often annoy other users. To help mitigate this problem, I propose implementing an age filtering system. Here are two ideas on how this could be achieved:\n\nAge Restriction for Worlds and Groups:\n\nAllow world and group owners to set a minimum age requirement, such as 16+ (or any others).\n\nThis age restriction information should be displayed when viewing the world or group details.\n\nUser Age Verification:\n\nEnable users to input their date of birth in their account settings.\n\nOptionally, include a checkbox for users to display their age in their profile.\n\nThis feature could also allow parents to set and lock the age in their children's profiles with a password.\n\nBy implementing these features, users who have their age set would be prevented from joining worlds or groups with age restrictions. This also applies to instances of these groups.\n\nThese changes would greatly enhance the user experience and safety within VRChat by allowing users to filter interactions based on age preferences.\n\nThank you for considering this request.",
